*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines_extended/redefines_multiple_nested_views
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines_extended.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BUFFER PIC X(8) VALUE "12345678".
01 WS-OUTER REDEFINES WS-BUFFER.
   05 WS-HI PIC 9(4).
   05 WS-LO PIC 9(4).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ADD 1 TO WS-HI.
    SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-LO.
    DISPLAY WS-HI.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-HI DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1235"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1235] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-LO.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-LO DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "5677"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [5677] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

